:: Pet Shop Lock

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "shopping_centre">><<effects>><<set $lock to 200>>
<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $lock>>
	<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
		<span class="blue">팔이 묶여 있지만 않다면</span> 자물쇠를 딸 수 있을 것 같다.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<wearProp "lockpick">>
		<span class="green">자물쇠는 쉽게 딸 수 있을 것 같다.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[자물쇠를 딴다 (0:10)|Pet Shop]]>><<pass 10>><<crimeUp 10 "trespassing">><</link>><<crime "trespassing">>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">이 자물쇠는 당신의 실력으로 딸 수 없을 것 같다.</span>
	<<skulduggeryrequired>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Shopping Centre]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pet Shop

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "shopping_centre">><<effects>>
당신은 애완동물 가게에 있다. <<if Time.dayState is "night" and Time.hour isnot $closinghour>>지금은 대부분의 동물이 잠들어 있다<<else>>작은 동물 몇 마리가 당신 쪽을 돌아본다<</if>>. 모두 귀여워 보이지만, <<if $avery_mansion and C.npc.Avery.state isnot "dismissed">>에이버리<<else>>베일리<</if>>【이가】 동물을 기르도록 허락해 줄지는 의문이다.
<br><br>

<<if Time.dayState is "night" and Time.hour isnot $closinghour>>
	그들 외에는, 어둠 속에 당신 혼자뿐이다.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
	당신은 존엄성을 지키기 위해 테라리움 뒤로 몸을 숨긴다. 비늘 덮인 주인이 호기심 어린 눈으로 당신을 깜빡인다.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutshop "shop">>
<<elseif Time.hour is $closinghour>>
	폐점 시간이다. 경비원이 모든 사람을 밖으로 몰아내고 있다.
	<<if $exposed gte 1>>
		경비원이 이 옷차림을 본다면 얼마나 수치스러울지 깨닫고 공황 상태에 빠진다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $exposed lte 0>>
		<<highicon>><<link [[밖으로 나간다|High Street]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<ind>><<link [["끝날 때까지 숨는다 (1:00)"|Pet Shop]]>><<pass 1 hour>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState is "night" and !$weekly.theft.petShop>>
		<<shopicon "register">><<link [[금전 등록기를 살펴본다|Pet Shop Register]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		<<if !$daily.seenPets and $fame.bestiality gte 200 and ["dog", "cat", "lizard"].some(type => animalSexEnabledForType(type))>>
			<<set $daily.seenPets to true>><<generate1>><<person1>>
			<<if $fame.bestiality gte 600>>
				가게로 들어서자 <<person>>【이가】 당신을 막아선다. <<Hes>> 가게 유니폼을 입고 이름표를 달고 있다. <<His>> 말투는 정중하지만 단호하다.
				"저 동물들은 제 책임하에 있으며, 어떤 식으로든 만지지 않으셨으면 합니다. 무언가 사러 오신 게 아니라면, 나가주세요." <<stress 12>><<ggstress>>
				<br><br>
			<<elseif $fame.bestiality gte 400>>
				직원 중 한 명이 당신의 모든 발걸음을 따라다니기 시작했다. <<his>> 경계하는 시선을 피할 수 없다. <<stress 6>><<gstress>>
				<br><br>
			<<else>>
				당신이 동물들에게 가까이 갈 때마다 가게 주인들이 예의주시한다. 이유는 잘 모르겠다.
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
			<<endevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.seenPets isnot true>>
			<<set $daily.seenPets to true>>
			가게를 둘러보며 고양이와 개 몇 마리를 쓰다듬는다. <<stress -6>><<lstress>>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $boughtItem isnot undefined>>
			<<generate1>><<person1>>You ask the shop owner for the <span class="gold"><<print $boughtItem>>.</span> "Certainly, <<pMs>>," <<he>> says with a smile. "I will have it delivered to your home as soon as I can."<<endevent>>
			<hr>
			<<PetShopBoughtItem>>
		<</if>>
		<<menagerieShop>>
		<br>
		<<if $pregnancyStats.wolfToysUnlocked>>
			<<if $player.inventory.childrenToys is undefined>>
				<<set $player.inventory.childrenToys to []>>
			<</if>>
			<<if !$storedChildrenToys>><<set $storedChildrenToys to {}>><</if>>
			<<toySelection>>
			<<petshopicon "chew">> <<link [[늑대용 씹는 장난감|Pet Shop Item]]>><<set $selectedToy to clone(_toySelection["chewToy"])>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $farm_stage gte 7>>
			<<petshopicon "treat">><<link [[Dog treats (<<printprice 100>> each)|Pet Shop Treats]]>><</link>> | Owned: <span class="gold"><<= $kennel_treats || 0>></span>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $pregnancyStats.parasiteDoctorEvents gte 2>>
			<<set _motherStatus to $sexStats.anus.pregnancy.parasiteBirthEvents + $sexStats.vagina.pregnancy.parasiteBirthEvents>>
			<<set _container to $container.home>>
			<br>
			<<if (_motherStatus is 0 and _container.upgrades.capacity lt 1) or (_motherStatus gt 0 and _container.upgrades.capacity lt 4)>>
				__수용량 업그레이드:__
				<br>
				<<if _motherStatus gte 0 and _container.upgrades.capacity is 0>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(20000) : 20000)>>
						<<petshopicon "tank small">><<link [[Buy small fish tank <<printprice 20000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Small Fish Tank">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.capacity lt 1>>
						You don't have <<printprice 20000>> for the Small Fish Tank.
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
				<<if _motherStatus gte 1>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(50000) : 50000) and _container.upgrades.capacity lt 2>>
						<<petshopicon "tank medium">><<link [[Buy fish tank <<printprice 50000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Fish Tank">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.capacity lt 2>>
						You don't have <<printprice 50000>> for the Fish Tank.
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(100000) : 100000) and _container.upgrades.capacity lt 3>>
						<<petshopicon "tank large">><<link [[Buy large fish tank <<printprice 100000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Large Fish Tank">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.capacity lt 3>>
						You don't have <<printprice 100000>> for the Large Fish Tank.
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(500000) : 500000) and _container.upgrades.capacity lt 4>>
						<<petshopicon "tank huge">><<link [[Buy huge fish tank <<printprice 500000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Huge Fish Tank">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.capacity lt 4>>
						You don't have <<printprice 500000>> for the Huge Fish Tank.
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if _motherStatus gte 1 and _container.upgrades.capacity gt 1>>
				<<if _container.upgrades.foodStorage lt 3>>
					<br>
					__먹이 업그레이드:__
					<br>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(50000) : 50000) and _container.upgrades.foodStorage lt 1>>
						<<petshopicon "feeder">><<link [[Buy small automatic feeder <<printprice 50000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Small Automatic Feeder">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.foodStorage lt 1>>
						You don't have <<printprice 50000>> for the Small Automatic Feeder.
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(150000) : 150000) and _container.upgrades.foodStorage lt 2>>
						<<petshopicon "feeder">><<link [[Buy automatic feeder <<printprice 150000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Automatic Feeder">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.foodStorage lt 2>>
						You don't have <<printprice 150000>> for the Automatic Feeder.
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(750000) : 750000) and _container.upgrades.foodStorage lt 3>>
						<<petshopicon "feeder">><<link [[Buy large automatic feeder <<printprice 750000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Large Automatic Feeder">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.foodStorage lt 3>>
						You don't have <<printprice 750000>> for the Large Automatic Feeder.
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if _container.upgrades.capacity gt 2>>
				<<if _container.upgrades.luxury lt 1 or (_container.upgrades.capacity gt 3 and _container.upgrades.luxury lt 2)>>
					<br>
					__장식 업그레이드:__
					<br>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(500000) : 500000) and _container.upgrades.luxury lt 1>>
						<<petshopicon "decor">><<link [[Buy standard decorations <<printprice 500000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Standard Decorations">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.luxury lt 1>>
						You don't have <<printprice 500000>> for the Standard Tank Decorations.
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(1500000) : 1500000) and _container.upgrades.luxury lt 2 and _container.upgrades.capacity gt 3>>
						<<petshopicon "decor exotic">><<link [[Buy exotic decorations <<printprice 1500000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Exotic Decorations">><</link>>
						<br>
					<<elseif _container.upgrades.luxury lt 2 and _container.upgrades.capacity gt 3>>
						You don't have <<printprice 1500000>> for the Exotic Tank Decorations.
						<br>
					<</if>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if $pregnancyStats.parasiteBook is 2>>
				<br>
				<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(2000) : 2000)>>
					<<assignmenticon>><<link [[Buy notebook (<<printprice 2000>>)|Pet Shop Book]]>><<money -2000 "petShop">><</link>>
				<<else>>
					<<assignmenticon>> You see a notebook available that you could use to collect info on your parasites. It costs <<printprice 2000>>. You can't afford it.
				<</if>>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
			<<if !_container.feedingAlarm>>
				<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(15000) : 15000)>>
					<<petshopicon "feeder">><<link [[Buy feeding alarm <<printprice 15000>>|$passage]]>><<set $boughtItem to "Feeding Alarm">><</link>>
				<<else>>
					You don't have <<printprice 15000>> for the Feeding Alarm.
				<</if>>
				<mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Clips onto the fish tank. It starts beeping two days before your parasites would starve, and stops when you check on them.</span></mouse>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Shopping Centre]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Pet Shop Treats
<<effects>>

진열된 다양한 개 간식을 살펴본다.
<br><br>

<<if $kennel_treats is undefined>>
	<<set $kennel_treats to 0>>
<</if>>

<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(100) : 100)>>
	<<petshopicon "treat">><<link [[Buy 1 (<<printprice 100>>)|Pet Shop Treats Buy]]>><<money -100 "petShop">><<set $kennel_treats += 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">돈이 부족해서 살 수 없다.</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(1000) : 1000)>>
	<<petshopicon "treat">><<link [[Buy 10 (<<printprice 1000>>)|Pet Shop Treats Buy]]>><<money -1000 "petShop">><<set $kennel_treats += 10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(5000) : 5000)>>
	<<petshopicon "treat">><<link [[Buy 50 (<<printprice 5000>>)|Pet Shop Treats Buy]]>><<money -5000 "petShop">><<set $kennel_treats += 50>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(10000) : 10000)>>
	<<petshopicon "treat">><<link [[Buy 100 (<<printprice 10000>>)|Pet Shop Treats Buy]]>><<money -10000 "petShop">><<set $kennel_treats += 100>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(20000) : 20000)>>
	<<petshopicon "treat">><<link [[Buy 200 (<<printprice 20000>>)|Pet Shop Treats Buy]]>><<money -20000 "petShop">><<set $kennel_treats += 200>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(50000) : 50000)>>
	<<petshopicon "treat">><<link [[Buy 500 (<<printprice 50000>>)|Pet Shop Treats Buy]]>><<money -50000 "petShop">><<set $kennel_treats += 500>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(100000) : 100000)>>
	<<petshopicon "treat">><<link [[Buy 1000 (<<printprice 100000>>)|Pet Shop Treats Buy]]>><<money -100000 "petShop">><<set $kennel_treats += 1000>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[아무것도 사지 않는다|Pet Shop]]>><</link>>

:: Pet Shop Treats Buy
<<effects>><<wearProp "dog treat">>

당신은 간식을 구매하여 농장으로 보낸다. 총 <span class="gold">$kennel_treats</span>개를 보유하고 있다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Pet Shop]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pet Shop Book
<<effects>><<wearProp "notebook">>
<<set $pregnancyStats.parasiteBook to 3>>
기생충에 대한 정보를 수집하는 데 사용할 수 있는 고품질 공책을 발견한다. 야생 동물의 과학적 연구를 위해 개별 페이지를 채울 수 있도록 되어 있지만, 기생충에게도 잘 맞을 것 같다고 생각한다. 당신은 그것을 구매한다.
<br><br>

<i>이제 당신이 낳은 기생충을 돌보는 장소 어디에서든 그들에 대한 정보를 볼 수 있습니다.</i>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Pet Shop]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Widgets PetShopBoughtItem [widget]

<<widget "PetShopBoughtItem">>
	<<if $boughtItem isnot undefined>>
		<<set _container to $container.home>>
		<<switch $boughtItem>>
		<<case "Small Fish Tank">>
			<<money -20000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.capacity to 1>><<set _container.maxCount to 2>><<set _container.name to "Small Fish Tank">>
		<<case "Fish Tank">>
			<<money -50000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.capacity to 2>><<set _container.maxCount to 3>><<set _container.name to "Fish Tank">>
		<<case "Large Fish Tank">>
			<<money -100000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.capacity to 3>><<set _container.maxCount to 4>><<set _container.name to "Large Fish Tank">>
		<<case "Huge Fish Tank">>
			<<money -500000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.capacity to 4>><<set _container.maxCount to 5>><<set _container.name to "Huge Fish Tank">>
		<<case "Small Automatic Feeder">>
			<<money -50000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.foodStorage to 1>><<set _container.maxDaysWithoutFood to 7>><<set _container.feederName to "Small Automatic Feeder">>
		<<case "Automatic Feeder">>
			<<money -150000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.foodStorage to 2>><<set _container.maxDaysWithoutFood to 14>><<set _container.feederName to "Automatic Feeder">>
		<<case "Large Automatic Feeder">>
			<<money -750000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.foodStorage to 3>><<set _container.maxDaysWithoutFood to 30>><<set _container.feederName to "Large Automatic Feeder">>
		<<case "Standard Decorations">>
			<<money -500000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.luxury to 1>><<set _container.decorations to "Standard Decorations">>
		<<case "Exotic Decorations">>
			<<money -1500000 "petShop">><<set _container.upgrades.luxury to 2>><<set _container.decorations to "Exotic Decorations">>
		<<case "Feeding Alarm">>
			<<money -15000 "petShop">><<set _container.feedingAlarm to true>>
		<</switch>>
		<<unset $boughtItem>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Pet Shop Item
<<toySelection>>
<<dynamic "toyUpdate" "toy-update-container">>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[뒤로|Pet Shop]]>><<run delete $selectedToy>><</link>>
<hr>
<div class="settingsHeader">늑대용 씹는 장난감</div>
<<dynamic "toyList" "toy-menu-container">>
